cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ScaleBench: A Reproducible Scoreboard for Auto-Renormalization in Weather Modeling"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "LSWM Project Team"
url: "https://github.com/Dolo-borigjin/The-everything"
abstract: >-
  Adjudication-first public benchmark for auto-renormalization in weather
  modeling: five task families targeting the five canonical failure modes of
  learned effective theories, with executable arbitration (reproduce.py),
  a deterministic leaderboard (v1.2, overall 0.9504), a live AIFS comparison
  harness with byte-level provenance, and rolling measured baselines.
license: MIT
version: "1.2"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
